{"version":1,"content":"<p>國際女團KATSEYE近期忙於舉行全球巡迴演唱會《The Wild World Tour》，而早前更宣布將於下年2月1日首度來港於啟德主場館開騷。</p><p>然而KATSEYE上星期原定於美國底特律等舉行的幾場演唱會，卻因為隊員Megan生病而取消。</p><p>事</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T03:14:43.601449+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T03:01:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T03:07:56.366245+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T03:07:56.366245+00:00","content_hash":"b720cde1b582a45cfaed25779e2cc324e9c4b7ab8375e54c7dd5aa387c7033b1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}